abstract: >
  Reference repository for the Institutional Capability Lineage Architecture
  (ICLA), including the scientific paper, executable specification,
  JSON Schemas, reference objects, end-to-end traces, deterministic reference
  implementation, and conformance tests for governed institutional capability
  evolution, bounded operational mandates, autonomous CEE execution, and
  contract-selected evidence.
  Documentation and scientific artifacts are licensed under
  CC BY 4.0.
  Source code is licensed under the MIT License.

